    - target: {fileID: 395447095955790642, guid: a6e74ec4d12861d4b821b29c48efb0cf,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'In this game, you play as a giant pair of fingers protecting a poor
        soul trapped in their home being overrun by zombies.


        Tap, swipe,
        and shake your device to kill the zombies before they get to the Poor Soul.
        If the Poor Soul gets attacked too much, they will die and you lose! Survive
        until your thumbs fall off!

'
